//! The BSC059N04LS6, Infineon OptiMOS 6, 40 V N-channel power MOSFET in TDSON-8 FL (fused
//! leads): Q1 to Q4 of the Power Manifold charger module (LCSC C534356,
//! `catalogs/bsc059n04ls6.csv`).
//!
//! The standard `NMosfet` has a pin table for the SOT-23 package only (gate 1, source 2, drain
//! 3), so the part provides it with its own table for this package. The pads are those of
//! Infineon's drawing "Outline TDSON-8 FL" (Rev. 2.0, 2018-07-31, "Final Data Sheet", page 1 for
//! the pin diagram, printed page 11 for the board pads): pins 1, 2 and 3 are the source `S`,
//! pin 4 the gate `G` and pins 5 to 8 the drain `D`. The footprint is one pad for the four
//! drain pins (the maker's board pads fuse the leads), numbered 5, as the reference board's
//! footprint (KiCad's `TDSON-8-1`) is; so the drain has the one pad `5`. The gate is an
//! `input`, the source and the drain `passive`, as the standard `NMosfet`'s.
//!
//! The ratings are the catalog row's (`catalogs/bsc059n04ls6.csv`, with their table and page).

import std::parts::transistor::NMosfet

/// The BSC059N04LS6: 40 V, 17 A (at 25 C ambient on 6 cm2 of copper), 5.9 mohm at 10 V.
part Bsc059n04ls6 provides NMosfet {
    pins "TDSON-8FL" {
        //  pin     kind     name  pads
        .gate   input   "G"   "4"
        .source passive "S"   "1" "2" "3"
        .drain  passive "D"   "5"
    }

    catalog bsc059n04ls6 by .mpn { .mpn, .package, .max_drain_source_voltage, .max_drain_current, .max_gate_source_voltage, .gate_threshold, .on_resistance, .on_resistance_vgs }
}
